# Explanation why the column nN-N is dropped
# nN-N: Number of N hydrazines (Mean: 0.0063, Std: 0.0793), nearly constant and not relevant for capturing variance in the classification task.
df.drop(columns=['nN-N'], inplace=True)

# Explanation why the column nArCOOR is dropped
# nArCOOR: Number of aromatic esters (Mean: 0.0537, Std: 0.3332), low variance and negligible presence in the data, which lowers its utility in predicting biodegradability.
df.drop(columns=['nArCOOR'], inplace=True)
end  

These combined steps will improve model performance while simplifying data complexity.
